		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h03_badrider3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ブラック[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]！
スピードだけが　おともだちっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
