		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ブラック[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]！
スピードだけが　お友達っ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
