		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ブラック[Name:PokemonName Idx="0" ]！
よあけまで　だいばくそう　だぜィ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
